{"type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn9le18ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn9le18ob10re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn9le18ob10re2img01.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn9le18ob10re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class= \"strong\"> Sally</span>: Peter, what are you doing here? <br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Peter</span>: I came over to talk. Are you going to let me in?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Sally</span>: So, Peter. It's late. I go to bed at 11:00. What's up?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Peter</span>: I just came from the bistro. I tried to talk to Vanessa, but she is irrational right now. She kicked me out of her bar. What kind of friend would throw another friend out of her bar?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Sally</span>: Peter. Listen. I'm glad you went over and faced the music, but she has every right to be heated with you.<br />", "id": 1, "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn9le18ob10re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class= \"strong\"> Peter</span>: C'mon Sally not you too. I told you guys. I gave you plenty of time.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Sally</span>: That's not the point. The point is Vanessa feels like you betrayed her. She feels like you took her and her friendship for granted.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Peter</span>: I don't though.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Sally</span>: Tell her that. <br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Peter</span>: Really, Sally? You know sometimes I get tired of the two of you leading me around like a little puppy; like some team mascot.  By next week, we will not be talking about this and we'll be friends again. I think Vanessa is blowing this way out of proportion.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Sally</span>: Maybe. But I'm telling you right now, she is angry. <br />", "id": 2, "time": "36700"}, {"image": "engenn9le18ob10re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class= \"strong\"> Peter</span>: Fine. What are you doing this Friday night because the three of us will be going out.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Sally</span>: Really!<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Peter</span>: By this time on Friday, you girls are going to be swept away. You will have been to the stars and back. Friday, Vanessa will have truly understood the phrase paint the town red. <br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Sally</span>: By this time next week, you are going to be asking everyone you know if you can borrow money.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Peter</span>: True.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Sally</span>: I'll lend you some.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Peter</span>: Thanks!<br />", "id": 3, "time": "69000"}]}}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about emotions, personal qualities and behavior.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about future action.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about what I will be doing or what I will have done.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Do you usually argue with your friends? Why? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Have you ever felt betrayed by someone? Why? Whose fault was it? What did you do to apologize? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "A way to apologize! ", "type": "free_type_text_area